Z||000000||firstfiero||12-05-2001||10:40 AM||||     Just got Madden 2002 for the pc and when I play it the players helmet and some of their bodies are all pixelized. I have the proper requirments to run the game and I downloaded the patch also. can anyone give some idea's of what I should look for that could be causing this? <BR>    This is why I hat pc games....You can't just play them. you always have to tinker with them for a couple of days.  <P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||falconhulk||12-05-2001||11:07 AM||||Get updated video drivers.  Also contact EA, it might be a know problem.  Either way they probably will get you going pretty fast.||||reg||1
Z||000002||The Fieromaster||12-05-2001||11:11 AM||||Make sure you check all the options for video settings!  It MAY not be in the game itself but could be in a seperate SETUP file thats with the game's exe in whatever folder it installed in!!  Thats how a few games i have are.  But if you loook in options it could be there... I found it not long ago in the Need For Speed 3 game.. damn when i crank it to what my Voodoo 3 can handle that game looks GOOD!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Adrift||12-06-2001||12:46 AM||||Has to do with the resolution your playing the game at. Go to the settings -&gt; video settings -&gt; set resoultion to at least 640x480 (The higher the number the better)||||reg||1
